					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doktori" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1169549); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1169549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607958913" alt="Doktori" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1169549)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doktori" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1169549); return false;" >Doktori</a></span> <span class="odate time_1338810748 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">04 Jun 2012 11:52</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1470069">
									

<p>I like the story, but the problems listed by the others do distract from your point. My opinion, but I would consider switching the ages/dates of her rape and her mother dying. If she was raped at 15, that would be even a bigger deal than if it happened when she was older. If she was 25 when her mother died, then her mother could be in her late 60's-early 70's, which would make her elderly, and would negate the issue of how a 15-year-old supported herself through college.</p>
<p>If her mother was hospitalized for a complication of her cancer, she might be hooked up to an ECG, etc, so the flat tone would happen on her death. However, she probably would be unconscious on morphine, etc. Maybe consider changing it to her mother's last words, and that Dr. Szu held her mother's hand under she died a few hours later. Only my opinion, of course.</p>
<p>This isn't your usual Mary Szu (sorry, I couldn't help myself).</p>

							</div>

								
					
